1
00:00:00,360 --> 00:00:03,165
The most important button in autonomous
commerce...

2
00:00:03,865 --> 00:00:06,348
is the one an agent refuses to press.

3
00:00:06,508 --> 00:00:07,777
Let me show you why.

4
00:00:11,360 --> 00:00:12,167
Tonight.

5
00:00:12,327 --> 00:00:13,210
La Palma.

6
00:00:13,370 --> 00:00:14,892
Two guests want the stars.

7
00:00:15,052 --> 00:00:16,213
A private guide.

8
00:00:16,373 --> 00:00:17,409
A telescope.

9
00:00:17,569 --> 00:00:18,519
Transport.

10
00:00:18,679 --> 00:00:22,587
One impossible checkout problem: what if
the sky disappears?

11
00:00:24,360 --> 00:00:26,974
ASTERION turns that wish into a mandate.

12
00:00:27,134 --> 00:00:29,206
Fifteen hundred euros maximum.

13
00:00:29,366 --> 00:00:30,503
Clear conditions.

14
00:00:30,663 --> 00:00:32,040
Explicit consent.

15
00:00:32,200 --> 00:00:35,556
The customer approves the outcome, the
price, and the limits.

16
00:00:37,360 --> 00:00:42,075
In our public simulation, supplier agents
negotiate a fourteen-eighty bundle.

17
00:00:42,235 --> 00:00:44,421
The server validates every allocation.

18
00:00:44,581 --> 00:00:49,202
One agreement coordinates three services,
with a versioned record of the exact

19
00:00:49,272 --> 00:00:50,336
approved terms.

20
00:00:51,360 --> 00:00:52,622
Now, authorize.

21
00:00:52,782 --> 00:00:54,105
Do not capture yet.

22
00:00:54,265 --> 00:00:55,997
The model can propose a deal.

23
00:00:56,157 --> 00:01:00,416
It cannot raise your budget, rewrite your
consent, or call payment tools.

24
00:01:03,360 --> 00:01:04,769
Arm the mandate once.

25
00:01:04,929 --> 00:01:06,363
The server takes over.

26
00:01:06,523 --> 00:01:10,750
Evidence must be complete, fresh, and
inside the approved thresholds.

27
00:01:10,910 --> 00:01:13,083
Here, the clear-weather fixture passes.

28
00:01:13,243 --> 00:01:15,404
The policy unlocks execution.

29
00:01:17,360 --> 00:01:18,501
Capture completes.

30
00:01:18,661 --> 00:01:20,743
Then three separate supplier payments.

31
00:01:20,903 --> 00:01:21,582
Guide.

32
00:01:21,742 --> 00:01:22,620
Telescope.

33
00:01:22,780 --> 00:01:23,699
Transport.

34
00:01:23,859 --> 00:01:27,683
The organizer is the merchant; supplier
Payouts follow capture.

35
00:01:27,843 --> 00:01:30,209
Every operation has a recorded state.

36
00:01:31,360 --> 00:01:32,439
But watch this.

37
00:01:32,599 --> 00:01:33,870
A second agreement.

38
00:01:34,030 --> 00:01:34,840
Clouds.

39
00:01:35,260 --> 00:01:36,412
Same policy.

40
00:01:36,572 --> 00:01:37,733
Capture blocked.

41
00:01:37,893 --> 00:01:39,399
Authorization voided.

42
00:01:39,559 --> 00:01:41,007
No supplier payments.

43
00:01:41,167 --> 00:01:43,116
Refusing to spend is a feature.

44
00:01:44,360 --> 00:01:47,012
Now inspect our recorded private results.

45
00:01:47,172 --> 00:01:49,337
Three actual Gemini requests.

46
00:01:49,497 --> 00:01:51,498
A seventeen-hundred-euro ceiling.

47
00:01:51,658 --> 00:01:53,252
Sixteen fifty agreed.

48
00:01:53,412 --> 00:01:57,707
That same agreement completed autonomous
PayPal Sandbox capture.

49
00:01:57,867 --> 00:02:01,869
The agreement and transaction references
remain inspectable.

50
00:02:04,360 --> 00:02:09,080
Three supplier Payouts individually
confirmed: four twenty-five, six twenty,

51
00:02:09,150 --> 00:02:10,370
four twenty-five.

52
00:02:10,530 --> 00:02:11,487
Test funds.

53
00:02:11,647 --> 00:02:13,715
Simulated inventory and weather.

54
00:02:13,875 --> 00:02:18,612
Separate financial operations, reconciled
against the same approved agreement.

55
00:02:19,360 --> 00:02:23,065
A complete receipt makes the decision
inspectable offline.

56
00:02:23,225 --> 00:02:25,553
Real forecasts already support planning.

57
00:02:25,713 --> 00:02:30,591
Local observations and actual operators
are the next validation milestone.

58
00:02:31,360 --> 00:02:32,873
La Palma is the first mission.

59
00:02:32,973 --> 00:02:35,886
Next: travel, events, complex business
purchases.

60
00:02:35,986 --> 00:02:37,185
One approved mandate.

61
00:02:37,285 --> 00:02:40,754
A payment infrastructure that can act,
wait, and explain its decision.

62
00:02:40,854 --> 00:02:42,093
Agents negotiate.

63
00:02:42,193 --> 00:02:43,604
Evidence unlocks payment.

64
00:02:43,704 --> 00:02:44,424
ASTERION.
